## Completed (2026-06-30)

- Canonical Ecosystem article (`vignettes/ecosystem.qmd`) added via worktree
  `feature/ecosystem-page` — PR #15 merged to `dev` ✓ (closes #14). Consolidates
  the package-role table previously scattered across `roadmap.Rmd`,
  `STATUS.md`, and `_pkgdown.yml`'s navbar dropdown. Flags `missingmed` as a
  planned-but-unbuilt package (referenced in `NEWS.md`/`roadmap.Rmd`, absent
  from `STATUS.md`/navbar). `pkgdown.yaml` deploys on push to `dev` too, so
  the live site updates without a `dev` → `main` release.
- Follow-up done (same day): each member package's own pkgdown Ecosystem
  navbar dropdown (RMediation, medfit, probmed, medrobust, medsim) now links
  out to this page instead of duplicating the package list — fixes drift
  found along the way (medfit had 3 stale "work in progress"-commented
  entries for already-live packages; medrobust used inconsistent
  `Data-Wise.github.io` casing). medsim previously had no Ecosystem nav
  entry at all; one was added. Committed directly to each repo's `dev`.

